          "label": "Author Responsibility Statement: By selecting this level, I affirm that I have critically reviewed, verified, and substantively revised any AI-assisted content in this activity. My own intellectual and creative contribution to this activity is substantial enough that I hold copyright in the final work, and I accept full responsibility for the accuracy, originality, instructional design, and POGIL alignment of the submitted activity.",
